WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.267 line:92%
-Welcome back to "Late Night."

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.102 line:92%
We're here with Casey Wilson

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:03.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're talking about
her fantastic new book.

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:05.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, Casey, I always find it's
very nice when people

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
who have been successful
in show business

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:12.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
share stories about how
it wasn't necessarily the case

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:12.846 size:88% position:44% line:92%
for their entire career.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:15.648
You write about an agent
showcase that you were not

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:18.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
particularly well,
I guess, prepared for?

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:20.020 line:92%
How would you describe it?

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was well-prepared,
but I made some wrong choices.

00:00:22.756 --> 00:00:25.058 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, an agent showcase is
when agents come,

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:26.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you have like
40 seconds to do

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
a monologue or
a scene and impress them

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:29.763 line:92%
for them to try to find you.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:33.299
And I picked a poignant scen
where I was being kidnappe

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I wore a paper bag
over my head

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:36.703 line:92%
the duration of the scene.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just
pulled it off at the end,

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:39.072 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and the lights went off.

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:42.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"My acting will be so stirring

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.979 align:start size:94% position:6%
and so good and my beauty
will -- my 40-year-old beaut

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:48.982 size:84% position:42%
at any age will shine
through that paper bag,

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:50.817 line:92%
and you'll want to sign me

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:52.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was not signed by
anyone, Seth.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:55.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But you do still have,
on your head shots,

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:59.059 line:92%
"special skills -- bag acting.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:02.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm great at it.
I can do plastic, brown bag --

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:02.796 line:92%
-You can do all the bags.

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:03.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's what everybody always
says about you.

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:07.600
-Canvas Lands' End bag.
I'll do anything you need, yeah.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I want to also
talk about some sad news.

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.772 size:88% position:44% line:92%
You recently lost a pet.

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:16.142 size:78% position:39%
Can you tell us about
your dearly departed?

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:17.143 line:92%
-It's hard to talk about, Seth

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:19.879
But people are going to thin
I'm doing a bit and I'm joking

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:20.480 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
and I'm not.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had a beta fish
named Spongy that

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:25.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was the only one
that took care of.

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:26.086 size:75% position:38% line:92%
My kids did nothing.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:28.788
And I would, like, sit by th
tank and look into his eyes.

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
They come when you
come in to feed them.

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:32.659 line:92%
There is a connection, Seth,

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:33.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
between people
and their beta fish.

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:36.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I loved this fish,
but, unfortunately,

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:38.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
I murdered him
when I put in some grass

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:40.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I bought from Amazon,
thinking he

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
could have,
like, a little hideaway.

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:43.403 size:75% position:38% line:92%
And it was so sharp,

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:46.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
unfortunately,
it speared Spongy.

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:50.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait. The thing
you bought to make it

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:53.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
a nicer locale for him
fully killed it?

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:55.148 line:92%
-That's right. Unfortunately

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:57.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, so, I -- This is a
public service announcement.

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:58.618 line:92%
Honestly, I'm mad at Amazon.

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:01.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
Never took the time to learn
the actual company

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:02.455 line:92%
that I bought the grass from

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:03.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I just want people
to be careful.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, you can
love something to death.

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:08.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because it was really
upsetting to see him speared

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:10.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
but a lot of people
have reached out to me

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
that they love
their beta fish, too.

00:02:11.798 --> 00:02:14.200 line:92%
One woman cremated hers, okay?

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
Another woman
tried mouth-to-mouth.

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:17.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
People are connected
to beta fish,

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:18.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I just don't feel
it's talked about enough.

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:22.008 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did you own up
to your family that you were -

00:02:22.008 --> 00:02:24.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you had brought about
the demise of the fish?

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.614 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. I was like,
"Oh, no, Spongy --

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:29.482 line:92%
something happened to him.

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:30.483 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You know what?

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:31.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
There are terrible people
in my family.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:34.521
Not one of them even,
like, registered Spongy's death.

00:02:34.521 --> 00:02:37.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was hysterically crying
to my husband,

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.258 line:92%
and he was, like, typing.

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:39.526 size:81% position:41% line:92%
He was like, "Mm-hmm."

00:02:39.526 --> 00:02:42.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're monsters.
Monsters, all of them.

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:45.231
-You do have a nice relationship
with your husband,

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
both personally
and professionally,

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:49.269 align:start size:94% position:6%
because he created
"Black Monday."

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:51.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
Third season of the show.
Congratulations.

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:54.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is it nice to
work with your spouse?

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It is nice.
It has some strange elements

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:59.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm in "Black Monday"
on Showtime,

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:01.114 line:92%
and so it's a bit racier.

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:02.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
He will --
I guess I'm 100 years old.

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:05.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he wrote a sex scene
for me in which --

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:07.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
And may I
speak freely here, Seth?

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:08.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Please, please.
-Okay.

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:10.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm, again,
a 40-year-old woman and a mom.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don't expect
to get these sex scenes

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:13.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
where you're being,
essentially --

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:16.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm sorry
to speak so freely --

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:18.298 line:92%
but taken from behind by a man

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:20.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
My husband is
at the monitor like,

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:24.237 size:84% position:42%
"Little to the left,
a little to the right."

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:25.271 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Doesn't care at all.

00:03:25.271 --> 00:03:28.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the gentleman playing
my paramour was

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:28.908 line:92%
Britney Spears' boyfriend,

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:31.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
so a lot was going on,
a lot of elements.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:32.111 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:33.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But he's
a wonderful actor, Sam.

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:35.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, there was a lot
going on at play.

00:03:35.415 --> 00:03:38.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
But my husband could give --
He doesn't care

00:03:38.518 --> 00:03:41.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
What's happening
with me out there, and...

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:43.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
So he's throwing me
out there to the wolves.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:45.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think that speaks to
the nice balance

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:48.161 line:92%
you have in your relationship.

00:03:48.161 --> 00:03:49.395 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-It's work-life balance.

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:50.530 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It's beautiful, really.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:53.166 size:78% position:39%
-Hey, congratulations
so much on the book.

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:55.134 size:75% position:38%
It is always so nice
to see you, Casey.

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:56.603 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you so much, Seth,
for having me.

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:58.271 line:92%
I love seeing you. Thank you

